   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Sounds of the letter G",
     "texto": [
      "Before **a, o, u**, the «g» sounds hard /g/, like the «g» in «go»: **gara**, **gusto**.",
      "Before **e, i**, the «g» sounds soft /dʒ/ (like the «j» in *jump*): **gelato**, **giorno**, **Gina**.",
      "To keep the hard sound before e, i, a silent «h» is added: **margherita**, **spaghetti**, **colleghi**.",
      "In the groups **gia**, **gio**, **giu**, the «i» is not pronounced as a separate vowel: it only shows the soft sound. That's why **giovedì** is pronounced «jo-veh-DEE»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
